---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Subscribe from '../components/Subscribe.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Javier Cruz — Performance marketing, in the open."
  description="Practitioner writing on dashboards, A/B testing, and the operational reality of performance marketing — plus an open SEO/GEO experiment tracking how this site ranks and gets cited."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-8">
        Performance marketing, in the open.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        Most of what I know about this work I did not figure out alone. I had managers and senior
        operators who were generous with their time and ruthless with their feedback. They taught
        me that the work is only as good as the decision it changes, and that a test you cannot
        defend is not really a test. This site is me writing those lessons down and passing them
        forward.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="/writing"
          class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors"
        >
          Read the Writing
        </a>
        <a
          href="/lab-notes"
          class="border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:border-gray-400 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors"
        >
          See the Lab Notes
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What this site is -->
  <section class="border-y border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 py-16" aria-labelledby="about-site-heading">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 id="about-site-heading" class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-10">
        What this site is
      </h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-10">

        <article>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">The craft</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Dashboards and reporting that drive decisions, not just describe what happened.
            A/B testing done in a way you can actually defend. The operational workflows behind
            the metrics — the parts of performance marketing nobody writes about honestly.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/writing"
            class="inline-block mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Read the writing →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">The lab</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            This site is the experiment. Every post is optimized with a real hypothesis.
            Rankings, traffic, and AI-engine visibility are tracked. Results — including
            the things that don't work — are posted openly in Lab Notes.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/lab-notes"
            class="inline-block mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors"
          >
            See the lab notes →
          </a>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Newsletter -->
  <Subscribe variant="full" />

</BaseLayout>
